
<p>Marcin Wichary on the <a href="https://daringfireball.net/linked/2026/10/24/apple-music-ipod-404-page">original iPod easter egg</a> on Apple Music’s website 404 page:</p>

<blockquote>
  <p>I am usually not a fan of easter eggs — most of them are poorly
made — but this might be the best iPod recreation I’ve seen, and
it’s an interesting thing to study:</p>

<ul>
<li>I think it generally covers all the modes etc.</li>
<li>(with small exceptions) the typography looks accurate,</li>
<li>it has the little “haptic” beeps,</li>
<li>it has proper acceleration and the scrollbar,</li>
<li>it has a little music library with various playlists,</li>
<li>I have only noticed a few small bugs.</li>
</ul>
</blockquote>

<p>It looks real, sounds real, feels real. Don’t bother with your easter egg idea if you’re going to half-ass it.</p>

